  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Fake news in oorlogstijd (2021), published by Leuven University Press, has no recorded citations yet, but it has been downloaded 1,620 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Fake news in oorlogstijd by Bruno Yammine was published by Leuven University Press in 2021. Conceptually, the work connects to Art and Humanities.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 1,620 times via OAPEN. Its subject matter aligns with Peace, Justice and strong institutions among the Sustainable Development Goals. The work was funded by KU Leuven and Fondation Universitaire de Belgique.</p>",
